WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:50.730
Hey youtubers it’s charlie, the full guardians
of the galaxy trailer just posted so I wanted

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:51.940
to do a review.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:55.440
We got 15 seconds this morning that included
some of the comic con footage that people

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:58.570
had already seen with the hooked on a feeling
song.

00:00:58.570 --> 00:00:59.770
Overall it was great.

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:01.350
Marvel took a big chance on this film by using
all these non-human characters, making the

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:02.350
setting off-world and using essentially B-level
marvel superheroes.

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:05.190
Normally they’d only spend this kind of
money on Robert Downey Jr and the avengers.

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.800
So let’s talk about the new footage.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:15.000
We got a better look at the main characters
we didn’t see in the teaser this morning

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.070
including Rocket Raccoon and the Nova Core
with John C Reilly.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:20.259
I loved that he got to do the lineup scene.

00:01:20.259 --> 00:01:22.200
It’s like the usual suspects marvel edition.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.970
It’s just meant to establish them as galactic
a holes who have to learn to be a team.

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:28.880
By themselves they’re all geniuses and the
best at what they do, but their attitude betrays

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.630
how awesome they can be when they work together.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:34.990
And that’s really the cool part that we’ll
get to see in the film.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:36.040
Them being bad ass together.

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:39.900
The film is supposed to pick up when Quill
is 9 years old, so there will probably be

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:44.280
at least one or two montages of him growing
up and then slowly assembling the team.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:47.090
That scene with John C Reilly looked like
it came much later in the film.

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:49.700
I was a little bummed we didn’t see ronan
the accusser or some of the other more important

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.330
secondary characters like nova and nova prime.

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:56.050
But the first trailer is always about the
core team.

00:01:56.050 --> 00:02:01.220
So in another month or two we’ll probably
get some new footage.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.330
My biggest questions right now are mostly
plot related because the trailer did do an

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:08.670
amazing job of showing us that visually the
film will look like classic star wars.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:09.930
Super grimy and amazing.

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:14.060
We didn’t get to hear Rocket Raccoon or
Groot speak which kind of sucks, but I imagine

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:17.260
they didn’t have to change vin diesel’s
voice much just because he’s already so

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.560
gravely.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:23.620
But I wonder what Bradley cooper is going
to sound like.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.319
Marvel and James Gunn were calling Rocket
Raccoon the heart of the film, so I can’t

00:02:26.319 --> 00:02:28.680
wait to see some extended scenes with the
character.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:34.050
Right now here are the top 5 things I want
to see in the next trailer.

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:36.019
Number 5 - Karen Gillan speaking

00:02:36.019 --> 00:02:40.720
Number 4 - Glenn close’s Nova Prime character

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:47.120
Number 3 - Lee Pace as Ronan The Accuser

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:55.040
Number 2 - Gamora beating the crap out of
someone

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:57.900
and number 1 - Rocket Raccoon cracking wise.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:02.630
But let me know what you thought of the trailer
and what do you want to see in the next one?

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:06.900
If you didn’t see I just posted a big preview
for the movie with character breakdowns.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.440
You can click here to watch it.

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:11.790
And click here for my review of the winter
soldier trailer.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:12.910
It’s almost here!

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:15.530
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:16.280
High Fives!

